    ('1cef558f-8c07-494e-b32a-6bb5690934a7'::uuid, 'card_description', 'A name meaning store of gold clings to these two Jain caves. The name reflects a persistent legend of treasure hidden within the cave walls, carved by hand into the base of a line of hills.', 'Two man-made caves carved into the Vaibhar Hills at Rajgir, Bihar — also known as Son Bhandar Caves. Some authors suggest they date to the Maurya Empire,...', 'teaser-card-s046-rollback:1cef558f-8c07-494e-b32a-6bb5690934a7:card_description', 'rollback of teaser-card-s046: card_description ''Two man-made caves carved into the Vaibhar Hills at Rajgir, Bihar — also known as Son Bhandar Caves. Some authors suggest they date to the Maurya Empire,...'' restored on Swarn Bhandar', 'fb217e35942a5739907d97d1db76173596838303d6330d096babcf19c69235a3|8ee0b9e7f20f21daaca330473c5c2435129480a8c27ba99363ee5f552c627ada|8ee0b9e7f20f21daaca330473c5c2435129480a8c27ba99363ee5f552c627ada', '[{"source": "lane WB run wb-shorts-wave-a2-2026-10-24: writer card_writer:teaser-write-003", "url": "output/remediation/teaser/runs/wb-shorts-wave-a2-2026-10-24/OUTCOMES.jsonl", "quote": "A name meaning store of gold clings to these two Jain caves. The name reflects a persistent legend of treasure hidden within the cave walls, carved by hand into the base of a line of hills."}, {"source": "lane WB run wb-shorts-wave-a2-2026-10-24: checker card_fact_checker:teaser-check-003 (check), PASS", "url": "output/remediation/teaser/runs/wb-shorts-wave-a2-2026-10-24/OUTCOMES.jsonl", "quote": "the site''s name means ''store of gold'' [S4]; the site consists of two caves [S1]; the caves are Jain [S1]; the name reflects a persistent legend of treasure hidden within the cave walls [S4]; the caves are man-made, carved by hand [S1]; they are carved into the base of a range of hills [S1]"}, {"source": "lane WB run wb-shorts-wave-a2-2026-10-24: verifier card_web_verifier:teaser-verify-006 (verify), VERIFIED", "url": "output/remediation/teaser/runs/wb-shorts-wa